## Installation

### Requirements
- Ubuntu / GNOME 46+
- Docker + Docker Compose
- Your user must be in the `docker` group

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/dockerpulse.git
cd dockerpulse

# Install
make install
